{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53847","headline":"曹娥庙 · 章孝标","name":"曹娥庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孝女魂兮何所之？故园遗庙两堪悲。\n岭头霞散漫涂脸，江口月沈难画眉。\n恨迹未消云黯黯，愁痕长在浪漪漪。\n人间荣谢不回首，千载波涛丧色丝。\n（嘉庆《曹江孝女庙志》卷八《题咏》。\n此则承陶敏先生告知。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}